[30.288295, "o", "───────────────┤\u001b[m \u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[0;1mDiscover Copilot Fusion\u001b[84C\u001b[0;37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[2;90m│\u001b[m Get 30% off Copilot Fusion usage through December 31, 2026.                                              \u001b[2;90m│\u001b[m \u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[34mClick here\u001b[m or enter /model fusion to switch\u001b[64C\u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[0;1mctrl+x → m\u001b[m switch for this session                         \u001b[48C\u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[2;90m╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[m \u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[108C\u001b[m\u001b[1K \u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[m ❯ Apply the search-performance-optimizer skill to login_failure_rate.spl2. You are authorized to      23:59 \u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[3C\u001b[msubmit this read-only search job with splunkctl --yes; do not change Splunk configuration. Detach\u001b[9C\u001b["]
